EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yesterday was {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Labor Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
My goodness, it passed by so fast!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I hope everyone enjoys it next year!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ayer fue el Día del Trabajo.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Se me ha pasado rapidísimo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}El año que viene será aún mejor.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hier, c'était la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fête du travail{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Je n'ai pas vu le temps filer !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Quelle belle journée on a passée...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ieri era la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Festa del lavoro{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Accifuffoli, è passata in un baleno!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Non vedo l'ora che ritorni!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Dün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Emek Günü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}ydü.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Aman, nasıl da çabucak geçti!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Umarım seneye herkes yine eğlenir!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Spero che tu resti con noi, oggi!
L'atmosfera per la Festa del lavoro{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}è speciale qui {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿Te está gustando el Día del
Trabajo?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} ¡Yo estoy trabajando{{TAG:0003:002C:}}
al doble de mi ritmo normal!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Emek Günü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} nasıl gidiyor?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Ben bugün {{TAG:0003:002C:}}her zamankinden de
sıkı çalışıyorum!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I think today's hard-worker award
should go to you, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}, for
coming all the way to {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}You probably worked the most of
all of us today just getting here!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Creo que el premio de hoy
al trabajador más incansable
debería ser para ti, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Solo por venir hasta {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}
ya has dado el callo más que nadie!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ne hai fatta di strada!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Spero
che resterai qui {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
per celebrare la {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Festa del lavoro{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}It's a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}picnic basket{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I hope you enjoy {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Labor Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} before
you head home tonight!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}¡Es una {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}cesta picnic{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Espero que te vayas a casa con un
