{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu gece eve dönmeden önce
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Emek Günü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}nün tadını çıkar!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh my!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Did you not get one of the
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Labor Day commemorative gifts{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
yet? {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Well then,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} here you go!

FR:
